msgid ""
"Exact selected-mode HIL preparation"
msgstr ""
"精确选定模式的 HIL 准备"

msgid ""
"The five contracts below prepare independent instrument acquisition for "
"software that already has exact selected providers. Every preparation "
"result remains `prepared_unbound` / `not_executed`. No board, probe, "
"serial peer or calibrated instrument is connected. Parser unit tests use"
" synthetic bytes and establish software contract behavior only."
msgstr ""
"以下五项合同针对已有精确选定 provider 的软件，准备独立仪器采集。所有准备结果仍为 `prepared_unbound` / "
"`not_executed`。未连接任何板卡、探针、串口对端或校准仪器。解析器单元测试使用合成字节，只能确立软件合同的行为。"

msgid ""
"Case"
msgstr ""
"用例"

msgid ""
"Exact selected configuration"
msgstr ""
"精确选定配置"

msgid ""
"Separate observations"
msgstr ""
"分别保留的观测"

msgid ""
"`H743-SPI-CACHE`"
msgstr ""
"`H743-SPI-CACHE`"

msgid ""
"STM32H743ZIT6 V `0x2003`, DEV `0x450`, HSI64/default trim, baremetal, "
"SPI4 PE12/13/14 AF5 and PE11 CS; cache on; DMA1 streams 2/3, requests "
"83/84"
msgstr ""
"STM32H743ZIT6 V `0x2003`，DEV `0x450`，HSI64／默认微调，baremetal，SPI4 "
"PE12/13/14 AF5 及 PE11 CS；Cache 开启；DMA1 流 2/3，请求 83/84"

msgid ""
"Whole exclusive 32-byte AXI lines, TX clean/RX prepare/invalidate, both "
"DMA completions, wire idle, CS release, withdrawal and settlement"
msgstr ""
"完整独占的 32 字节 AXI Cache 行，TX Cache clean／RX prepare/invalidate，两个 DMA "
"均完成、线上空闲、CS 释放、撤回与 SETTLED 发布"

msgid ""
"`H743-RX-CONTINUOUS`"
msgstr ""
"`H743-RX-CONTINUOUS`"

msgid ""
"Same exact H743 silicon/clock/backend; USART3 PD8/PD9, DMA1 stream "
"1/request 45, continuous RX; cache off or on"
msgstr ""
"相同的精确 H743 硅片／时钟／后端配置；USART3 PD8/PD9，DMA1 流 1／请求 45，连续 RX；Cache 关闭或开启"

msgid ""
"Actual CT/M0AR/M1AR/NDTR rotations, equal caller blocks, held contents, "
"service deadlines, loss, stop and loan return; TX remains IRQ"
msgstr ""
"实际 CT/M0AR/M1AR/NDTR 轮换、等大的调用方块、持有块的内容、服务截止时间、丢失、停止与块借用的归还；TX 仍使用 IRQ"

msgid ""
"`H743-DUPLEX-CONTINUOUS`"
msgstr ""
"`H743-DUPLEX-CONTINUOUS`"

msgid ""
"Same exact H743 silicon/clock/backend and USART3 pins; separate DMA1 "
"stream 0/request 46 TX and stream 1/request 45 RX; cache off or on"
msgstr ""
"相同的精确 H743 硅片／时钟／后端及 USART3 引脚；独立的 DMA1 流 0／请求 46 用于 TX，流 1／请求 45 用于 "
"RX；Cache 关闭或开启"

msgid ""
"Independent finite TX request and continuous RX stream loans, real "
"DMA/wire TC, CPU acquire-visible bytes, lane-local EN refusal and "
"joint-domain quarantine"
msgstr ""
"独立的有限 TX 请求与连续 RX stream 借用、真实 DMA／线上 TC、CPU acquire 后可见的字节、通路自身的 EN "
"拒绝撤回，以及联合域隔离保留"

msgid ""
"`U575-TX-CHAIN`"
msgstr ""
"`U575-TX-CHAIN`"

msgid ""
"STM32U575ZIT6Q, TZEN0/SWAP_BANK0, MSIS 4 MHz, baremetal; USART1 "
"PA9/PA10; GPDMA1 channel 0/request 25; IRQ RX"
msgstr ""
"STM32U575ZIT6Q，TZEN0/SWAP_BANK0，MSIS 4 MHz，baremetal；USART1 "
"PA9/PA10；GPDMA1 通道 0／请求 25；IRQ RX"

msgid ""
"Finite contiguous SRAM1 payload, two packed 12-byte nodes, one 64 KiB "
"CLBAR window, LAST termination, wire TC and complete withdrawal"
msgstr ""
"有限连续 SRAM1 载荷、两个紧凑排列的 12 字节节点、一个 64 KiB CLBAR 窗口、LAST 终止、线上 TC 及完整撤回"

msgid ""
"`U575-LPTIM-RUN`"
msgstr ""
"`U575-LPTIM-RUN`"

msgid ""
"Same U575 preboot/clock/backend; internal LPTIM2, PCLK1/4, 1 MHz RUN "
"ticks, IRQ68 priority5/calls_os=false"
msgstr ""
"相同的 U575 启动前条件／时钟／后端；内部 LPTIM2，PCLK1/4，1 MHz RUN tick；IRQ 68，优先级 "
"5，calls_os=false"

msgid ""
"2..65536 ticks, actual enable/disable synchronization, full-period UE, "
"deadline, quarantine and withdrawal"
msgstr ""
"2..65536 个 tick、实际启用／停用同步、完整周期后的 UE、截止时间、隔离保留与撤回"

msgid ""
"Preparation and admission"
msgstr ""
"准备与准入"

msgid ""
"The ordinary `workloads.py` and `soc_acceptance.py` catalogs contain "
"these cases. Their selectors use exact canonical resolved controller "
"IDs, mode, clock, backend, physical DMA lanes and bounded descriptor "
"contracts. A chip family name or another UART instance does not select a"
" case. Native, FreeRTOS and ThreadX do not inherit these baremetal mode "
"contracts. The continuous RX contract does not select finite IDLE RX or "
"DMA duplex mode."
msgstr ""
"常规 `workloads.py` 和 `soc_acceptance.py` 清单包含这些用例。选择器使用精确、规范化的已解析控制器 "
"ID、模式、时钟、后端、物理 DMA 通路及有界描述符合同。芯片系列名称或另一个 UART 实例不能选中用例。Native、FreeRTOS 和"
" ThreadX 不继承这些 baremetal 模式合同。连续 RX 合同不选择有限 IDLE RX 或 DMA 双向模式。"

msgid ""
"The maintained software fixtures are:"
msgstr ""
"维护的软件 fixture 包括："

msgid ""
"`tools/hil/fixtures/stm32h743_hsi_selected_reference.json`;"
msgstr ""
"`tools/hil/fixtures/stm32h743_hsi_selected_reference.json`；"

msgid ""
"`tools/hil/fixtures/stm32u575_nucleo_zi_q.json` for the USART1 Board "
"identity;"
msgstr ""
"`tools/hil/fixtures/stm32u575_nucleo_zi_q.json`，用于 USART1 Board 身份；"

msgid ""
"`tools/hil/fixtures/stm32u575_lptim_selected_reference.json`."
msgstr ""
"`tools/hil/fixtures/stm32u575_lptim_selected_reference.json`。"

msgid ""
"The two additional reference Board/part pairs are explicitly recorded in"
" the admission guard. Removing `scope`, changing the Board name or "
"changing a part cannot promote them. `validate_station` continues to "
"reject software-reference fixtures. The earlier H743/U575 GPIO and "
"IRQ-byte smoke fixture limits remain in force. New mode preparation does"
" not widen a smoke qualification."
msgstr ""
"准入保护明确记录了这两组额外的参考 Board／料号组合。删除 `scope`、更改 Board "
"名称或更改料号都不能提升它们的资格。`validate_station` 仍然拒绝软件参考 fixture。先前 H743/U575 GPIO "
"和 IRQ 字节冒烟 fixture 的限制继续有效。新模式的准备不扩大冒烟验证资格。"

msgid ""
"SPI-only and pinless LPTIM assemblies have no selected smoke console. "
"Their plans state `independent_control_channel_unbound`; the descriptive"
" future UART route does not create a UART controller. Instrument "
"identities and numeric limits remain unset until an actual station is "
"reviewed. A future physical station needs a separately reviewed fixture "
"and corresponding tooling change before the existing acquisition runner "
"can operate it."
msgstr ""
"仅 SPI 和无引脚 LPTIM 装配没有选定用于冒烟测试的控制台。其计划标为 "
"`independent_control_channel_unbound`；对未来 UART 路由的描述不会创建 UART "
"控制器。实际测试站通过审查前，仪器身份和数值限值保持未设置。未来的物理测试站必须具有单独审查的 fixture "
"和对应工具变更，现有采集执行器才能操作它。"

msgid ""
"The first command produces an unbound plan. The second produces an "
"incomplete authoring template. Neither command flashes firmware, starts "
"an adapter, supplies station facts or accepts the template as a reviewed"
" protocol."
msgstr ""
"第一条命令生成未绑定的计划，第二条生成不完整的编写模板。两条命令都不会刷写固件、启动适配器、提供测试站事实或将模板接受为已审协议。"

msgid ""
"Independent raw observations"
msgstr ""
"独立原始观测"

msgid ""
"Each case has its own reviewed protocol and stimulus inventory. Four "
"separately retained JSON exports form its observation contract:"
msgstr ""
"每个用例都有各自的已审协议和激励清单。四份分别保留的 JSON 导出记录构成其观测合同："

msgid ""
"Role"
msgstr ""
"角色"

msgid ""
"Required content"
msgstr ""
"必需内容"

msgid ""
"`mode_registers`"
msgstr ""
"`mode_registers`"

msgid ""
"Controller/mode and source/divider/trim/cache/security readback, chip "
"identity, `nominal_core_hz`, IRQ policy and exact DMA lanes"
msgstr ""
"控制器／模式与时钟源／分频／微调／Cache／安全配置的读回值，芯片身份、`nominal_core_hz`、IRQ 策略及精确 DMA 通路"

msgid ""
"`wire_capture`"
msgstr ""
"`wire_capture`"

msgid ""
"Per-trial retained transmitted/received bytes or timer-tick observations"
msgstr ""
"每次试验保留的发送／接收字节或定时器 tick 观测"

msgid ""
"`memory_capture`"
msgstr ""
"`memory_capture`"

msgid ""
"Per-trial caller addresses/capacities/exclusive ownership, retained "
"payload snapshots, descriptor links, and held-block snapshots for RX"
msgstr ""
"每次试验的调用方地址／容量／独占所有权，保留的载荷快照、描述符链接及 RX 持有块快照"

msgid ""
"`lifecycle_events`"
msgstr ""
"`lifecycle_events`"

msgid ""
"Per-trial acceptance, absolute monotonic deadline/domain/epoch, strictly"
" ordered timestamps and lifecycle events; RX includes actual "
"target-register snapshots"
msgstr ""
"每次试验的接受结果、绝对单调截止时间／时间域／epoch、严格有序的时间戳与生命周期事件；RX 还包括实际目标寄存器快照"

msgid ""
"Every export uses schema 1 `selected_mode_observation` and binds its "
"case, role, fresh capture session, reviewed protocol hash, context hash,"
" exact controller ID and a reviewed instrument. A missing role, "
"duplicate trial, wrong session, changed file, different selected "
"instance or altered clock/cache fact fails. The per-case contract "
"rejects unknown effects and access after settlement. There is no "
"declared `pass` field that substitutes for observations."
msgstr ""
"每份导出记录使用 schema 1 "
"`selected_mode_observation`，并绑定其用例、角色、新的采集会话、已审协议哈希、上下文哈希、精确控制器 ID "
"和已审仪器。角色缺失、试验重复、会话错误、文件改变、选定实例不同或时钟／Cache 事实改变都会判为失败。逐用例合同拒绝未知效果及SETTLED"
" 发布后的访问。不存在可替代观测的声明式 `pass` 字段。"

msgid ""
"Register, memory and lifecycle exports bind the reviewed debug probe. "
"Wire exports bind the logic analyzer, or the calibrated timer for LPTIM."
" Merely naming a different instrument from the same protocol does not "
"satisfy a role. U575 revision IDs must be observed as actual 16-bit "
"integers; the current provider has no selected revision allow-list, so "
"the parser records the value without inventing a revision gate. H743 "
"retains its exact V `0x2003` gate."
msgstr ""
"寄存器、内存和生命周期导出记录绑定已审调试探针。线上导出记录绑定逻辑分析仪；LPTIM "
"则绑定校准定时器。仅写出同一协议内另一台仪器的名称，不能满足角色要求。U575 修订 ID 必须实际观测为 16 位整数；当前 provider"
" 没有选定的修订允许列表，因此解析器记录该值，不虚构修订准入门禁。H743 保留精确的 V `0x2003` 门禁。"

msgid ""
"`nominal_core_hz` describes the configured clock tree. It does not "
"measure HSI or MSIS accuracy in SI hertz. Event `at_ns`, deadlines and "
"service samples use a nanosecond conversion of the same live target Core"
" monotonic domain, named `monotonic1` by this export contract. They are "
"not automatically calibrated SI nanoseconds. An external instrument must"
" retain its actual frequency, calibration, uncertainty and mapping to "
"that domain. Frequency error and absolute physical latency remain "
"separate reviewed measurements; an oscillator need not run at "
"mathematically exact 64 MHz or 4 MHz."
msgstr ""
"`nominal_core_hz` 描述配置的时钟树，并不以 SI 赫兹测量 HSI 或 MSIS 的准确度。事件 "
"`at_ns`、截止时间和服务采样使用同一正在运行的目标 Core 单调时间域的纳秒换算值，本导出合同将该域命名为 "
"`monotonic1`。这些值不会自动成为经过校准的 SI "
"纳秒。外部仪器必须保留实际频率、校准、不确定度及其到该域的映射。频率误差和绝对物理延迟仍是分别审查的测量；振荡器不必运行在数学上精确的 64 "
"MHz 或 4 MHz。"

msgid ""
"The existing `soc_acceptance.capture` path reuses the exclusive station "
"lock, bounded adapter subprocesses, firmware/readback identity, timeout "
"and cleanup recording. Validation rebuilds admission, verifies the "
"executed argv and input closure, matches the adapter's actual manifest "
"and verifies raw identities before the selected-mode parser runs. "
"Standalone parser success carries no physical status. Final case metrics"
" must equal the values derived from parsed trials."
msgstr ""
"现有 `soc_acceptance.capture` "
"路径复用独占测试站锁、有界适配器子进程、固件／读回身份、超时及清理记录。校验会重建准入结果，核验已执行的 argv "
"和输入闭包，匹配适配器的实际清单，并在选定模式解析器运行前核验原始记录身份。单独运行解析器成功不携带任何实板状态。最终用例指标必须等于从已解析试验推导的值。"

msgid ""
"Instruments and station adapters remain external station-owned "
"integrations. The platform does not ship a universal SPI peer, waveform "
"decoder, debug-probe capture driver or automatically connected serial "
"device. Production stimulus firmware must use the exact admitted "
"assembly and its public typed interfaces; changing it requires a new "
"ELF/configuration/resource identity and capture."
msgstr ""
"仪器和测试站适配器仍是由外部测试站拥有的集成。平台不提供通用 SPI "
"对端、波形解码器、调试探针采集驱动或自动连接的串口设备。生产激励固件必须使用精确获准的装配及其公共类型化接口；更改固件需要新的 "
"ELF／配置／资源身份和采集。"

msgid ""
"Stimulus and boundary obligations"
msgstr ""
"激励与边界义务"

msgid ""
"SPI cache DMA exercises 32-byte and 65504-byte transfers, late "
"cancellation near TC, late withdrawal timeout, misaligned storage and "
"invalid length. Both borrowed buffers are disjoint exclusive complete "
"cache lines inside AXI SRAM. TX DMA TC and RX DMA TC precede observed "
"wire idle; RX invalidation and CS release precede successful settlement."
" A withdrawal-timeout trial deliberately reaches wire completion but "
"fails later reference withdrawal: it must remain quarantined past its "
"deadline and cannot publish settlement or release ownership. It does not"
" qualify arbitrary DMA hangs."
msgstr ""
"SPI Cache DMA 覆盖 32 字节和 65504 字节传输、接近 TC "
"时的后期取消、撤回后期超时、未对齐存储和无效长度。两个被借用的缓冲区均由 AXI SRAM 内完整、独占且互不重叠的 Cache 行构成。TX "
"DMA TC 和 RX DMA TC 先于观测到的线上空闲；RX Cache 失效处理和 CS 释放先于成功发布 "
"SETTLED。撤回超时试验特意达到线上完成，却在后续引用撤回时失败：超过截止时间后仍必须隔离保留，不得发布 "
"SETTLED或释放所有权。这不构成对任意 DMA 挂起情形的资格确认。"

msgid ""
"Cancellation cases retain the actual cancel call before wire/stream "
"withdrawal; a scenario label alone cannot establish that stimulus. "
"Rejected cases retain verified byte-identical before/after memory, zero "
"observed wire activity, no transmitted/received payload and no borrow. "
"Referencing a missing snapshot or changing rejected storage fails "
"validation. The duplex contract applies rejection to the rejected "
"direction: an already active RX stream continues during TX-overlap "
"rejection. A rejected RX start does not submit a TX request."
msgstr ""
"取消用例保留在线上传输／数据流撤回前发生的实际 cancel "
"调用；仅有场景标签不能证明该激励发生。拒绝用例保留已核验逐字节相同的前后内存，且观测到的线上活动为零，没有发送／接收载荷，也没有借用。引用缺失的快照或更改被拒绝的存储都会导致校验失败。双向合同将拒绝条件限定于被拒绝的方向：TX"
" 因重叠被拒绝时，已经活动的 RX 数据流继续运行。被拒绝的 RX 启动不会提交 TX 请求。"

msgid ""
"Continuous RX exercises wrap, held-block backpressure, IDLE stop, "
"service-budget expiry, cancellation with a held block, overlapping "
"blocks and undersized blocks. At least three equal disjoint caller AXI "
"blocks are required. Each accepted trial retains an initial target "
"snapshot and at least three CT transitions during its observation "
"warm-up. Snapshots include CR, M0AR, M1AR, NDTR, held addresses and "
"explicitly returned addresses. Held blocks cannot appear in either armed"
" target. Every transition is timestamped in the same domain and meets "
"the conservative minimum receive interval computed from observed NDTR "
"progress and the real ten-bit 8N1 frame, with two 1 us quanta for sample"
" uncertainty. This calculation is separate from the intentionally "
"conservative eight-bit service guard below. When CT flips, the newly "
"active target must remain unchanged; only the just completed inactive "
"target may be replaced, and that completed address must be the newly "
"held loan. Independent held snapshots must remain byte-identical."
msgstr ""
"连续 RX 覆盖环绕、持有块反压、IDLE 停止、服务预算到期、持有块期间取消、块重叠及块容量不足。至少需要三个等大、互不重叠的调用方 AXI "
"块。每次接受的试验保留初始目标快照，以及观测预热阶段至少三次 CT 切换。快照包括 "
"CR、M0AR、M1AR、NDTR、持有地址及明确归还的地址。两个已配置生效的目标中都不得出现持有块。每次切换都在同一时间域内标注时间戳，并满足根据观测到的"
" NDTR 进度及真实十位 8N1 帧计算的保守最小接收间隔，同时为采样不确定度计入两个 1 us "
"量化单位。此计算与下文刻意保守的八位服务保护界限分别处理。CT "
"翻转时，新变为活动状态的目标必须保持不变；只能替换刚完成传输的非活动目标，且该完成地址必须对应新持有的借用块。独立保留的持有块快照必须始终逐字节相同。"

msgid ""
"The replacement budget uses the actual captured block capacity, sampled "
"NDTR and selected BRR, rather than a requested byte count supplied "
"independently:"
msgstr ""
"替换预算使用实际采集的块容量、采样 NDTR 和选定 BRR，而不使用独立提供的请求字节数："

msgid ""
"TIM2 and USART must share the selected nominal 64 MHz HSI domain. The "
"20-byte guard and two 1 us quanta are conservative bounds. Late service "
"and backpressure report loss and stop; they cannot silently continue "
"with a held buffer. Cache-on blocks use complete exclusive 32-byte "
"lines. Cache-off observations cannot inherit cache-on maintenance "
"events. A new stream after stop needs a fresh explicit submission; the "
"protocol does not assert an automatic restart policy."
msgstr ""
"TIM2 和 USART 必须共享选定的标称 64 MHz HSI 时间域。20 字节保护量和两个 1 us "
"量化单位是保守界限。服务迟到和反压必须报告丢失并停止；不得悄然继续使用持有缓冲区。Cache 开启时，块使用完整独占的 32 字节行。Cache"
" 关闭时的观测不能继承 Cache 开启时的维护事件。停止后的新数据流需要重新显式提交；协议不规定自动重启策略。"

msgid ""
"Independent H743 duplex case"
msgstr ""
"独立 H743 双向用例"

msgid ""
"`H743-DUPLEX-CONTINUOUS` has its own case ID, protocol, stimulus, "
"session and raw inventory. It cannot reuse a passed `H743-RX-CONTINUOUS`"
" capture. Both cache profiles require the same nine production-reachable"
" scenarios:"
msgstr ""
"`H743-DUPLEX-CONTINUOUS` 有自身的用例 ID、协议、激励、会话及原始记录清单。即使 "
"`H743-RX-CONTINUOUS` 的采集结果通过，也不能复用。两种 Cache 配置都要求相同的九个生产实现可达场景："

msgid ""
"`tx_min`: 1 byte with caches off, or one 32-byte line with caches on;"
msgstr ""
"`tx_min`：Cache 关闭时为 1 字节，Cache 开启时为一条 32 字节 Cache 行；"

msgid ""
"`tx_max`: 65535 bytes off, or 65504 bytes on;"
msgstr ""
"`tx_max`：Cache 关闭时为 65535 字节，Cache 开启时为 65504 字节；"

msgid ""
"`cancel_tx_tc`: actual cancel after observed DMA TC and before wire TC;"
msgstr ""
"`cancel_tx_tc`：实际 cancel 发生在观测到 DMA TC 之后、线上 TC 之前；"

msgid ""
"`stop_rx_held`: producer detaches while a consumer still holds a block;"
msgstr ""
"`stop_rx_held`：consumer 仍持有一个块时，producer 解除引用；"

msgid ""
"`tx_drain_timeout`: TX EN withdrawal refuses after DMA and wire "
"completion;"
msgstr ""
"`tx_drain_timeout`：DMA 和线上均完成后，TX EN 拒绝撤回；"

msgid ""
"`rx_drain_timeout`: RX EN withdrawal refuses and `stop_rx` returns "
"`BUSY`;"
msgstr ""
"`rx_drain_timeout`：RX EN 拒绝撤回，且 `stop_rx` 返回 `BUSY`；"

msgid ""
"`domain_taint`: observed HSIDIV change, retained loans and three-IRQ "
"isolation;"
msgstr ""
"`domain_taint`：观测到 HSIDIV 改变、保留借用并隔离三个 IRQ；"

msgid ""
"`reject_tx_overlap`: TX storage aliases the already bound RX pool;"
msgstr ""
"`reject_tx_overlap`：TX 存储与已绑定 RX 池发生别名重叠；"

msgid ""
"`reject_rx_overlap`: overlapping RX blocks are rejected without TX "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"`reject_rx_overlap`：重叠 RX 块被拒绝，不提交 TX 请求。"

msgid ""
"The RX acquisition window contains an initial DMA target sample and at "
"least three genuine CT transitions. It demonstrates overlap with the "
"beginning of TX; it does not claim continuous RX for the entire "
"approximately 5.69-second maximum TX. An actual station must retain the "
"exact observed interval. Normal TX can settle while RX remains active. "
"The finite request's `SETTLED` state never names the RX stream or joins "
"an independent adapter observer."
msgstr ""
"RX 采集窗口包含初始 DMA 目标采样及至少三次真实 CT 切换。它证明与 TX 起始阶段重叠，不声称在约 5.69 秒的最长 TX 全程连续"
" RX。实际测试站必须保留精确的观测区间。正常 TX 可以在 RX 仍活动时发布 SETTLED。有限请求的 `SETTLED` 状态既不指代 "
"RX 数据流，也不负责 join 独立的适配器 observer。"

msgid ""
"`memory_capture` separates three equal AXI RX blocks from one "
"independently sized AXI TX payload. Cache-on payloads occupy exclusive "
"complete 32-byte lines; nonempty request lengths also cover complete "
"lines. The caller's static owner, stream, three-slot reservation and "
"request controls use the selected AAPCS32 minimum sizes 272, 40, 120 and"
" 32 bytes and 8-byte alignment. Larger reservations are allowed. "
"Controls are disjoint from payloads and from each other; nested members "
"are not separate reservations. Control sizes need not be cache-line "
"multiples. This reference workload observes `wake_address=0` and "
"attaches no external wake object."
msgstr ""
"`memory_capture` 将三个等大的 AXI RX 块与一个大小独立确定的 AXI TX 载荷区分开。Cache "
"开启时，载荷占用完整独占的 32 字节行；非空请求长度也必须覆盖完整行。调用方静态 owner、stream、三槽预留及 request "
"控制存储采用选定 AAPCS32 下的最小尺寸，依次为 272、40、120 和 32 字节，并按 8 "
"字节对齐。允许更大的预留。控制存储彼此不重叠，也不与载荷重叠；嵌套成员不计为单独预留。控制存储大小不必是 Cache 行大小的倍数。本参考 "
"workload 观测 `wake_address=0`，不挂接外部 wake 对象。"

msgid ""
"TX before/after bytes must remain unchanged. RX `rx_before` is an "
"initial poison pattern; `rx_after` is the debug-probe view of physical "
"DMA memory, and `rx_cpu_visible` is a separate capture of the bytes read"
" by the CPU after stream acquire. Physical RAM alone does not prove "
"cache coherence. The RX observation binds address, slot epoch, length, "
"completion, invalidation, publication, acquire and sample times to "
"actual target and slot-state snapshots. Held before/after bytes bind the"
" same consumer address and epoch throughout the retained interval. Fault"
" scenarios sample the consumer still held after failed stop or "
"isolation, rather than an older block already returned before the fault."
msgstr ""
"TX 前后字节必须保持不变。RX `rx_before` 是初始毒化模式；`rx_after` 是调试探针读取的物理 DMA "
"内存视图，`rx_cpu_visible` 则单独采集 CPU 在 stream acquire 之后读取的字节。仅有物理 RAM 不能证明 "
"Cache 一致性。RX 观测将地址、槽 epoch、长度，以及完成、Cache 失效处理、块发布、acquire "
"和采样的时间，绑定到实际目标及槽状态快照。持有块的前后字节在保留的整个区间内绑定同一 consumer 所持块地址及 "
"epoch。故障场景采样的是停止失败或隔离后仍由 consumer 持有的块，而非故障前已归还的旧块。"

msgid ""
"TX `snapshots` retain actual Core request state, the independent "
"`preparing` flag, active request address/ref, publisher state, DMA "
"CR/NDTR/PAR/M0AR/FCR, DMAMUX CCR and USART CR1/CR3/ISR plus DMA LISR. "
"Core states remain `READY`, `ACTIVE`, `DRAINING`, `QUARANTINED` and "
"`SETTLED`; `PREPARING` and `REJECTED` are not invented Core states. A "
"cold pre-clean baseline may have zero PAR, M0AR and NDTR. It must remain"
" unchanged during preparation, with EN and DMAT off. Launch uses TDR "
"`0x40004828`, request 46, finite byte MINC TX and the exact V TRBUFF "
"policy. RX uses RDR `0x40004824`, request 45 and the selected byte DBM "
"configuration. Unknown modes, widths, directions and lane substitutions "
"fail."
msgstr ""
"TX `snapshots` 保留实际 Core 请求状态、独立的 `preparing` 标志、活动请求地址／ref、发布者状态、DMA "
"CR/NDTR/PAR/M0AR/FCR、DMAMUX CCR、USART CR1/CR3/ISR 及 DMA LISR。Core 状态仍为 "
"`READY`、`ACTIVE`、`DRAINING`、`QUARANTINED` 和 `SETTLED`；不得将 `PREPARING` 和 "
"`REJECTED` 虚构为 Core 状态。冷态 Cache clean 前的基线可具有为零的 PAR、M0AR 和 "
"NDTR。准备期间基线必须保持不变，EN 和 DMAT 均关闭。启动使用 TDR `0x40004828`、请求 46、有限且字节宽度的 "
"MINC TX，以及精确的 V 修订 TRBUFF 策略。RX 使用 RDR `0x40004824`、请求 45 及选定的字节 DBM "
"配置。未知模式、宽度、方向或替换 DMA 通路都会判为失败。"

msgid ""
"DMA TC requires actual NDTR zero and TCIF0. A fresh wire TC and "
"successful withdrawal both precede settlement; DMA TC alone releases "
"nothing. A delayed software DMA sample may follow the physical wire "
"edge. The cancellation trial deliberately samples DMA TC before "
"cancellation and wire TC. Non-success `transferred=0` does not imply "
"zero transmitted bytes: these post-DMA-TC cancel and EN-refusal trials "
"require the full independent wire payload. Only the taint trial permits "
"a captured source prefix within its pre-fault observation window. TX "
"settlement requires EN, DMA interrupt sources including HTIE, DMAT and "
"UART TX sources withdrawn, flags cleared, the publisher joined and "
"active pointer/ref removed. It does not disable RX or the shared USART "
"NVIC line."
msgstr ""
"DMA TC 要求实际 NDTR 为零且 TCIF0 置位。新的线上 TC 和成功撤回均先于 SETTLED 发布；仅 DMA TC "
"不释放任何内容。延迟的软件 DMA 采样可能晚于物理线上边沿。取消试验特意在取消和线上 TC 之前采样 DMA TC。非成功结果中的 "
"`transferred=0` 不表示发送字节为零：这些在 DMA TC 后取消及 EN "
"拒绝撤回的试验，要求独立线上采集保留完整载荷。只有域污染试验允许在故障前观测窗口内捕获源载荷前缀。发布 TX SETTLED 要求 EN、包含 "
"HTIE 在内的 DMA 中断源、DMAT 及 UART TX 源已撤回，标志已清除，发布者已 join，活动指针／ref 已移除。它不会禁用 "
"RX 或共享 USART NVIC 中断线。"

msgid ""
"The finite TX drain deadline starts at the actual drain entry, with the "
"provider budget `floor(20000000 / baud) + 100` microseconds. A failed "
"withdrawal retains the request through actual expiry. RX has no "
"equivalent provider TX deadline: its `BUSY` return, still-enabled EN "
"readback, withdrawn RX sources, retained producer loans and expiration "
"of a separately declared station stop budget are recorded independently."
" Slot snapshots retain producer loans/pending, each slot's state and "
"epoch, stream outstanding count and stopping state. A consumer can keep "
"`BORROWED` outstanding after producer loans reach zero. `BUSY` never "
"revokes it."
msgstr ""
"有限 TX 排空截止时间从实际进入排空时起算，provider 预算为 `floor(20000000 / baud) + 100` "
"微秒。撤回失败时，请求须保留并跨过实际到期时刻。RX 没有与之对应的 provider TX 截止时间：其 `BUSY` 返回、仍为启用的 EN"
" 读回、已撤回的 RX 源、保留的 producer 借用及单独声明的测试站停止预算到期，均分别记录。槽快照保留 producer "
"借用／pending、每个槽的状态与 epoch、stream 的 outstanding 计数和 stopping 状态。producer "
"借用降至零后，consumer 仍可以保留未归还的 `BORROWED` 块。`BUSY` 绝不会撤销该借用。"

msgid ""
"Joint taint records actual RCC CR/HSICFGR, CCR and clock-epoch "
"observations. The last valid Core-domain boundary, injected fault, first"
" software observation of domain loss and completed isolation are "
"separate facts. The access trace is scoped to USART3, DMA1 and DMAMUX: "
"after software observes domain loss it permits no further access to that"
" invalid I/O domain, cache maintenance or publication. RCC/SCB detection"
" and NVIC isolation remain permitted. This is not a guarantee of zero "
"instructions between an external RCC write and its later software "
"detection. Three IRQs, DMA1 stream 0, stream 1 and USART3, must be "
"disabled and their publishers inactive; both directions' loans remain "
"quarantined. Domain loss does not itself set the stream's normal "
"`stopping` flag."
msgstr ""
"联合域污染记录实际 RCC CR/HSICFGR、CCR 及 clock-epoch 观测。最后有效的 Core "
"时间域边界、注入故障、软件首次观测到域丢失，以及隔离完成，是分别记录的事实。访问轨迹的范围限定为 USART3、DMA1 和 "
"DMAMUX：软件观测到域丢失后，不得再访问该失效 I/O 域，也不得进行 Cache 维护或发布。仍允许通过 RCC/SCB 检测及执行 "
"NVIC 隔离。这不保证外部 RCC 写入与随后软件检测之间不执行任何指令。三个 IRQ，即 DMA1 流 0、流 1 及 "
"USART3，必须已禁用，且其发布者处于非活动状态；两个方向的借用均保持隔离保留。域丢失本身不会设置 stream 的正常 `stopping`"
" 标志。"

msgid ""
"After clock invalidation, the held-byte and pure-memory request tail "
"snapshots use independently retained capture sequence numbers around "
"fault, observation and isolation. They do not invent an elapsed Core "
"deadline in the dead domain. All ordinary RX rotations and service "
"samples precede the boundary and still satisfy the existing eight-bit "
"replacement guard and ten-bit wire lower bound."
msgstr ""
"时钟失效后，持有字节和纯内存请求尾部快照使用围绕故障、观测及隔离分别保留的采集序列号。它们不在已失效的时间域内虚构 Core "
"截止时间已经到期。所有常规 RX 轮换及服务采样都先于该边界，且仍满足既有的八位替换保护量及十位线上时间下界。"

msgid ""
"Cancellation during the synchronous cache-clean call remains a "
"host/model white-box regression using GoogleMock substitution. "
"Production cache clean has no callback, and cancel belongs to the same "
"single executor. Such reentry is not a tenth physical HIL scenario; no "
"worker, ISR cancellation or new hook is added to make it appear "
"reachable."
msgstr ""
"同步 Cache clean 调用期间的取消仍属于采用 GoogleMock 替换的 host／模型白盒回归。生产实现的 Cache clean"
" 没有回调，cancel 由同一个唯一 executor 执行。这种重入不是第十个物理 HIL 场景；没有为使其看似可达而添加 "
"worker、ISR 取消或新 hook。"

msgid ""
"The finite U575 chain exercises 1, 65535, 65536, 131070 and 131071 "
"bytes, cancellation near TC, late withdrawal timeout, an invalid "
"descriptor window and invalid length. The theoretical public count limit"
" is 196605 bytes, but the actual disjoint SRAM1 payload must also leave "
"space for generated nodes, state, ring and control storage. The "
"multi-block trial therefore requires more than 131070 bytes and "
"validates actual placement rather than demanding an impossible "
"simultaneous full 192 KiB payload and private nodes. "
"`three_block_threshold` names the 131071-byte stimulus; it does not "
"claim a physical maximum. Nodes are packed at offsets 0 and 12 from a "
"32-byte-aligned base and remain in one 64 KiB window. Capture the actual"
" packed `block`, `source` and `link` words, initial CLBAR/CLLR/CSAR/CBR1"
" and each hardware fetch snapshot. A one-block transfer leaves both pool"
" entries zero and has initial `CLLR=0`. Two-block transfers use one "
"fetched node; three-block transfers use two. The actual UB1/USA/ULL "
"update bits and LA offsets must match the source progression and final "
"zero link. Successful withdrawal clears channel references and all node "
"words. A failed withdrawal retains legal 32-bit references and the "
"published nodes. Chain completion alone does not replace DMA/IRQ "
"withdrawal and wire TC."
msgstr ""
"有限 U575 链覆盖 1、65535、65536、131070 和 131071 字节、接近 TC "
"时取消、撤回后期超时、无效描述符窗口及无效长度。公共计数的理论上限为 196605 字节，但实际互不重叠的 SRAM1 "
"载荷还必须为生成节点、状态、环及控制存储留出空间。因此多块试验要求超过 131070 字节，并校验实际放置，而非要求不可能同时容纳的完整 192"
" KiB 载荷和私有节点。`three_block_threshold` 表示 131071 字节激励，不声明物理最大值。节点在相对基址的偏移 "
"0 和 12 处紧凑排列，基址按 32 字节对齐，且节点保持在同一个 64 KiB 窗口内。必须采集实际紧凑排列的 "
"`block`、`source` 和 `link` 字、初始 "
"CLBAR/CLLR/CSAR/CBR1，以及每次硬件取节点的快照。单块传输使两个池条目均保持为零，初始 "
"`CLLR=0`。双块传输使用一个硬件取出的节点，三块传输使用两个。实际 UB1/USA/ULL 更新位和 LA "
"偏移必须与源地址推进及最终零链接一致。成功撤回会清除通道引用及所有节点字。撤回失败则保留合法的 32 位引用和已发布节点。仅链完成不能替代 "
"DMA／IRQ 撤回和线上 TC。"

msgid ""
"LPTIM exercises 2-tick and 65536-tick boundaries, early ARRM, "
"synchronization delay, late withdrawal timeout and one-tick rejection "
"with no effects. Enable/disable write/readback/DSB anchors must "
"demonstrate the required synchronization interval. The delayed case must"
" retain a readback delay beyond the ordinary synchronization interval. "
"UE cannot precede the full requested nominal-domain period. This is a "
"fixed-clock RUN contract. It establishes no RTC, backup, VBAT, "
"autonomous, Stop or TrustZone behavior."
msgstr ""
"LPTIM 覆盖 2 tick 和 65536 tick 边界、提前出现 ARRM、同步延迟、撤回后期超时，以及不产生效果的单 tick "
"拒绝。启用／停用的写入／读回／DSB 锚点必须证明所要求的同步间隔。延迟用例必须保留超过普通同步间隔的读回延迟。UE "
"不得早于所请求的完整标称时间域周期。这是固定时钟的 RUN 合同，不确立 RTC、备份、VBAT、自主运行、Stop 或 TrustZone "
"行为。"

msgid ""
"Delivery status and further execution"
msgstr ""
"交付状态与后续执行"

msgid ""
"The software delivery includes selectors, unbound plans, strict reviewed"
" protocols, existing-runner integration, raw parsing and negative parser"
" tests. No physical station has been bound and no case has executed on "
"hardware. Keep the original raw capture, adapter stdout/stderr, receipt "
"and firmware/resource identities when hardware becomes available. Record"
" the exact successful case, mode, silicon and conditions; a "
"selected-mode result cannot qualify another controller, cache profile, "
"backend, Board or product."
msgstr ""
"软件交付包括选择器、未绑定计划、严格的已审协议、现有执行器集成、原始记录解析及解析器负向测试。尚未绑定物理测试站，也没有用例在硬件上执行。硬件可用时，须保留原始采集记录、适配器"
" stdout/stderr、回执及固件／资源身份。须记录成功用例、模式、硅片和条件的精确信息；选定模式的结果不能为其他控制器、Cache "
"配置、后端、Board 或产品建立资格。"
